  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 103.35 Major docking system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 103.35 “Major docking system” means a docking structure that:\n\n(a) Is a commercial docking structure, a public docking structure, or one in which docking structures impact 100 or more linear feet of shoreline;\n\n(b) Provides 5 or more boat slips; or\n\n(c) Is associated with a breakwater.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13106, eff 9-25-20; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 103.33)",
